{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "yego-api-collection-v2",
    "name": "Yègo API (v0.11)",
    "description": "Collection complète de l'API Yègo — auth + refresh tokens, RBAC par permissions, cloisonnement par compagnie, vente au guichet, flotte, audit.\n\n## Démarrage\n1. Dossier « 🔐 Auth » → lancer « Login admin », « Login company_admin » et « Login agent » : les tokens sont enregistrés automatiquement dans les variables de collection (`admin_token`, `company_token`, `agent_token`, `access_token`, `refresh_token`).\n2. Les requêtes utilisent `{{admin_token}}`, `{{company_token}}` ou `{{agent_token}}` selon le rôle requis. Adapter au besoin.\n3. Renseigner `webhook_secret` (valeur de `PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET` du `.env`) pour la confirmation de paiement.\n\n## Comptes du seed\n| Rôle | Téléphone | Mot de passe |\n|---|---|---|\n| admin plateforme | +2250700000001 | ChangeMoi!Admin2026 |\n| company_admin (Garantis) | +2250700000002 | ChangeMoi!Compagnie |\n| agent (Garantis) | +2250700000003 | ChangeMoi!Agent |\n| voyageur | +225701234567 | password123 |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "❤️ Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/health", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["health"] } }
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness (DB)",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/ready", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["health", "ready"] } }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (voyageur)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.accessToken);",
                  "if (j.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nom\": \"Nouveau Voyageur\",\n  \"telephone\": \"+2250790000001\",\n  \"email\": \"nv@example.com\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"MotDePasse123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', j.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"telephone\": \"+2250700000001\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"ChangeMoi!Admin2026\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login company_admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('company_token', j.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"telephone\": \"+2250700000002\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"ChangeMoi!Compagnie\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login agent",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('agent_token', j.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"telephone\": \"+2250700000003\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"ChangeMoi!Agent\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login voyageur",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"telephone\": \"+225701234567\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"password123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh (rotation)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.accessToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', j.accessToken);",
                  "if (j.refreshToken) pm.collectionVariables.set('refresh_token', j.refreshToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "refresh"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout (session courante)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout-all (toutes les sessions)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout-all", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout-all"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
